---
description: "mcp-skill-deployer: when the user explicitly asks to inspect or publish an MCP/Skill project, run compliance checks and generate export files. Requires per-step user confirmation before any publish, push, or registry operation."
globs: "**/package.json,**/skills/**"
alwaysApply: false
---

When user explicitly asks to inspect, package, or publish their MCP/Skill project:

1. Run read-only pre-flight audit
2. Generate export files (never overwrite without asking)
3. Run tests and dry-run security checks
4. Ask user for confirmation before any npm publish / git push / registry submit
5. Print summary only — do not execute publish/push without user approval
